<title>USA: Smithfield Foods president &amp; COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Smithfield Foods president &amp; COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smithfield Foods Inc said Tuesday that John Nielson has resigned as president and chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>No reason was provided.</p>
<p>The company said Lewis Little will succeed Nielson as its president and chief operating officer. Little had been president and chief operating officer of a Smithfield subsidiary, Gwaltney of Smithfield Ltd, the company said.</p>
</text>
